      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "STRATEGY :\n1. we have to give\nminimum number of \ncpu intervals\n\n2. there must be \ngap of n of tasks \nof same label\n\n3. we can use \nhash map , but we \nwant to use heap here\n\n4. I think i have to use\nmin heap here as required \nis for minimum number of cpu \nintervals , CORRECTION : \nMAX HEAP WILL BE USED \n\n5. I think the first step \nis to set all values in a map",
      "fontSize": 20,
